  "title": "Qt: Fix tap parameter dialog expand all nodes check",
  "description": "The intent in TapParameterDialog is to expand all the nodes if\nthe total number of nodes in the tree is less than some arbitrary\nnumber, currently 100.\n\nui->statsTreeWidget->model()->rowCount() doesn't give the total number\nof rows in the tree, only the number of children of the root node.\n\nIterate over the tree (breaking if we hit our maximum) and expand\nthe nodes if there are that many total nodes.\n\nPing #20038",
